  "summary": "7 features across HagiCode-org/hagicode-core, HagiCode-org/web.",
  "bodyHtml": "<h2 id=\"features\">Features</h2>\n<h3 id=\"hagicode-orghagicode-core\">HagiCode-org/hagicode-core</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>application:</strong> support radio-group preset field renderer (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/hagicode-core/commit/db2fac7ff962ef12064736f11934f43a952e874a\"><code>db2fac7</code></a>)</li>\n<li><strong>web:</strong> output auto-compose-commit results as a markdown table (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/hagicode-core/commit/c79e699ddfa38ad2d59d7a3c5e8dcf133a76c6f9\"><code>c79e699</code></a>)</li>\n<li><strong>web:</strong> add GPT 6.0 Sol and Luna secondary professions (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/hagicode-core/commit/4beb916e9ae74d5fd41a88984f7f2c2d4123357e\"><code>4beb916</code></a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"hagicode-orgweb\">HagiCode-org/web</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>preset-task:</strong> validate unsupported field renderers (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/web/commit/0ee2eb03edc541225da1e6fdd6faf9523f862e5c\"><code>0ee2eb0</code></a>)</li>\n<li><strong>preset-task:</strong> support radio-group field renderer (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/web/commit/8a657e351e61afc7f894e2bc0614ccc13c5f8d61\"><code>8a657e3</code></a>)</li>\n<li><strong>hero:</strong> add table views and bulk actions to system settings (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/web/commit/7b4fb8be1723c6cfc5b62d73975b57593caf252f\"><code>7b4fb8b</code></a>)</li>\n<li><strong>theme:</strong> keep loading shell and SPA theme in sync (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/web/commit/a33767f3f56493df3b85bea6735fe0f9bcdae971\"><code>a33767f</code></a>)</li>\n</ul>",
